# B06V1 reversible engine test using the 16550 COM1 Scratch Register.
# Port 0x3ff is COM1 base 0x3f8 + SCR offset 7. The 16550 defines SCR as an
# eight-bit software scratchpad; it does not control baud rate or data flow.
# Run in keep mode, inspect the transaction, then request manual rollback.

read io 03ff b
write io 03ff b 5a rev
assert io 03ff b ff 5a
mask io 03ff b 0f 05 rev
assert io 03ff b ff 55
poll io 03ff b ff 55 10
delay 100
